Source code for network users (AGPL-3.0, section 13)
----------------------------------------------------

If you use Liner Notes over a network, you can get the Corresponding Source of the version you
are using, at no charge, from its repository:

    https://github.com/josefdc/liner-notes

The web app's footer links to it ("Source"). Anyone who runs a modified version for others
must offer that version's source in the same way: setting VITE_SOURCE_URL when the web app is
built points the footer link at it (see docs/development.md).


